      "message": "fix(ui): the window-icon fallback logs through the diag seam\n\nwindow_icon() reported a failed icon decode with a direct eprintln!,\nwhich the diag law test (shared_ui_code_prints_only_through_the_diag_seam)\nrejects: a browser drops a direct print. The line now goes through\ndiag_warn!, same text, same behaviour (None, the window opens without\nan icon).\n\nPinned by diag::tests::shared_ui_code_prints_only_through_the_diag_seam\n(red with eprintln! restored at app_icon.rs:25, green here).\n\nFixes #1475",
